    "body": "## Problem\n\nDescribe the problem (concisely).\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```sh\nseq 100 | git column --mode=column | nvim --clean\n# or more obvious with this cmd\n# cal 2026 | nvim --clean is more obviously\n```\nthen type `/\\d\\+<CR>1Qiabc`\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/504e2a5f-3edc-40de-a1c0-fee4c3efc5b4\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nno escape sequence print to screen\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1661 g4b5dcbccd7` neovim/neovim@4b5dcbccd7\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: ?\n- Operating system/version: Linux 7.1.8-zen1-3-zen\n- Terminal name/version: kitty\n- $TERM environment variable: `xterm-kitty`\n- Installation: ?\n\n",
